 proof/SecureORO.eca          | 14 +++++++-------
 proof/SecureRO.eca           | 11 ++++++-----
 proof/smart_counter/Gcol.eca |  2 +-
 proof/smart_counter/Gext.eca |  4 ++--
 4 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

